  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/ulinaaron/rivet-files</url>
  <url type="bugtracker">https://github.com/ulinaaron/rivet-files/issues</url>
  <url type="vcs-browser">https://github.com/ulinaaron/rivet-files</url>
  <description>
    <p>
      Rivet Files is a classic Linux file manager in the same vein as Nemo, Thunar and Caja, written in Rust. It does not use GTK or Qt.
    </p>
    <p>
      Icon, list and compact views, tabs, a sidebar, Trash, and picture thumbnails. Colors follow matugen, Noctalia and GTK theme files.
    </p>
  </description>
